{"id":"szkesfehrvr","name":"塞克什白堡","en":"Székesfehérvár","country":"Hungary","lat":47.191,"lng":18.4108,"dek":"王座之城，废墟上的加冕记忆","history":"盖萨大公在972年建起这座城，选址在一片沼泽环绕的高地上。地名里的“塞克”来自突厥语，意思是王座，暗示了它从一开始就与权力有关。此后数百年，这里成为匈牙利王国真正的中心，国王在此加冕，也在此下葬。\n\n蒙古人退去后，城池重建，加冕传统延续下来。直到中世纪结束，数十位国王的加冕礼在塞克什白堡的教堂里完成，其中不少君主最终也长眠于此。那座教堂在奥斯曼战乱中损毁严重，此后再未恢复原貌。\n\n土耳其人占领期间，居民几乎消亡殆尽，城市一度空寂。18世纪起，陆续有人迁回，巴洛克式的建筑在旧日王城的遗址上慢慢立起。王座早已不在，但城市的骨架仍叠着几个时代的痕迹。","culture":"塞克什白堡的日常里，中世纪记忆并不张扬。老城的地面下埋着王家教堂的残基，街面上则是十八世纪以后的房子，颜色柔和，墙面有细密的装饰线脚。博物馆里收着从废墟中清理出的石雕和墓石，有些上面还刻着拉丁文。\n\n这里也是欧尔班·维克托的出生地，他早年在这座城市生活、读书，后来走向布达佩斯的政治舞台。城市不大，却同时承载着王朝旧事与当代政治的线索，两种时间在街角并行，互不打扰。","pull":"加冕与埋葬，都在同一片废墟附近","sights":[{"name":"圣伊什特万大教堂","orig":"Szent István-székesegyház","intro":"18世纪后期建起的主教座堂，立面朴素，内部空间高敞。它建在中世纪王家教堂遗址附近，地下与周边仍保留着旧日地基的痕迹。走进侧廊，能看到从废墟中移来的石雕残件，线条粗粝。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Saint_Stephen%27s_Basilica_-_panoramio_-_fabiolah_%281%29.jpg/960px-Saint_Stephen%27s_Basilica_-_panoramio_-_fabiolah_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":null},{"name":"废墟花园","orig":"Romkert","intro":"中世纪王家教堂的遗存被露天保护起来，石墙基座围成一片安静的下沉空间。加冕与埋葬都曾发生在这里，如今只剩低矮的墙根和几块石刻。站在步道上往下看，能辨认出柱础的排列。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_1963%2C_Romkert._Fortepan_50762.jpg/960px-Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_1963%2C_Romkert._Fortepan_50762.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1341},"src":null},{"name":"主教宫","orig":"Püspöki palota","intro":"老城中心的巴洛克建筑，立面有对称的窗列和简洁的山花。它属于主教座堂建筑群的一部分，外观不事张扬，与周边的街道尺度相称。经过时留意门楣上的装饰，细节比远看丰富。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Bishop%27s_Palace%2C_Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_01.jpg/960px-Bishop%27s_Palace%2C_Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"市政厅","orig":"Városháza","intro":"位于老城广场一侧的公共建筑， nineteenth-century 风格，立面有拱窗和浅色涂装。广场开阔，四周是步行街，当地人穿行其间。建筑本身不对外开放，但外观与广场的关系值得看一眼。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_1940%2C_a_V%C3%A1rosh%C3%A1za_%C3%A9s_el%C5%91tte_a_T%C3%ADzes_husz%C3%A1rok_szobra._Fortepan_6128.jpg/960px-Sz%C3%A9kesfeh%C3%A9rv%C3%A1r_1940%2C_a_V%C3%A1rosh%C3%A1za_%C3%A9s_el%C5%91tte_a_T%C3%ADzes_husz%C3%A1rok_szobra._Fortepan_6128.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":798},"src":null},{"name":"黑鹰药房博物馆","orig":"Fekete Sas Patikamúzeum","intro":"老药房改成的博物馆，木制药柜和柜台保留着旧时格局。架上摆着瓷瓶与铜秤，墙面有褪色的彩绘。空间不大，却能把十八世纪药房的日常还原出来，适合在步行途中顺路进去。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Szekesfehervar_Fekete_Sas_Patikamuzeum_01.JPG/960px-Szekesfehervar_Fekete_Sas_Patikamuzeum_01.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"匈牙利炖牛肉","orig":"Gulyás","intro":"牛肉与土豆、胡萝卜慢炖，汤色红亮，靠大量甜椒粉提味。当地餐馆常盛在陶碗里，配白面包蘸汤吃。汤体不稠，入口先是甜椒的香，再是肉的厚味。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Gulyas080.jpg/960px-Gulyas080.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goulash"},{"name":"渔夫汤","orig":"Halászlé","intro":"以河鱼和甜椒粉熬成的浓汤，颜色深红，味道偏辣。传统做法用多种鱼同煮，汤里常见鱼块。巴拉顿湖一带的版本偏清淡，塞克什白堡的餐馆也能吃到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Balatoni_hal%C3%A1szl%C3%A9_093_%284375939627%29.jpg/960px-Balatoni_hal%C3%A1szl%C3%A9_093_%284375939627%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":726},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BC%81%E5%A4%AB%E6%B9%AF"},{"name":"兰戈斯","orig":"Lángos","intro":"油炸的扁面饼，表面金黄起泡。最常见的是抹酸奶油再撒奶酪丝，趁热吃，外脆内软。集市和街边摊上现炸现卖，拿在手里烫手，是当地速食里最朴素的一种。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Langos_in_Berlin_1.jpg/960px-Langos_in_Berlin_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":816},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%98%AD%E6%88%88%E6%96%AF"},{"name":"多博什蛋糕","orig":"Dobostorta","intro":"多层海绵蛋糕夹巧克力奶油，外层裹硬糖壳，顶面用焦糖划出格纹。切的时候糖壳会裂开，口感脆与软交替。老城咖啡馆的柜台上常能见到，配咖啡刚好。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Dobos_cake_%28Gerbeaud_Confectionery_Budapest_Hungary%29.jpg/960px-Dobos_cake_%28Gerbeaud_Confectionery_Budapest_Hungary%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dobos_torte"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/V._Zichy-h%C3%A1z%2C_k%C3%A9s%C5%91bb_Magyar_sz%C3%A1ll%C3%B3_%283831._sz%C3%A1m%C3%BA_m%C5%B1eml%C3%A9k%29.jpg/1280px-V._Zichy-h%C3%A1z%2C_k%C3%A9s%C5%91bb_Magyar_sz%C3%A1ll%C3%B3_%283831._sz%C3%A1m%C3%BA_m%C5%B1eml%C3%A9k%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":526},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Szekesfehervar_Orb_and_Episcopal_Palace.JPG/1280px-Szekesfehervar_Orb_and_Episcopal_Palace.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[18.3287434,47.2077221],[18.3318251,47.2031866],[18.3351763,47.2028232],[18.3391114,47.2009448],[18.3408439,47.1971501],[18.3733197,47.1733553],[18.3746579,47.1690594],[18.3890122,47.1497691],[18.390574,47.1480475],[18.3972202,47.1476495],[18.4087541,47.1337857],[18.410071,47.1218307],[18.4092107,47.1191532],[18.4055212,47.1145113],[18.3966583,47.1095155],[18.4022339,47.1080078],[18.4274656,47.1089712],[18.4606326,47.1221818],[18.4710015,47.1109639],[18.4774053,47.1170346],[18.4999998,47.1244938],[18.5091059,47.1295164],[18.5196175,47.1369139],[18.5240058,47.1347642],[18.5177814,47.1393703],[18.5417982,47.1532784],[18.5479784,47.1491158],[18.5